# Felwood, Alliance ~52 to ~54 (consensus visit 63).
# Flow: Rut'theran Village -> Auberdine -> Astranaar -> the Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Jadefire Glen
# -> Jaedenar and Shadow Hold (Arko'narin) -> the Sanctuary -> Jaedenar's moonwell and Rakaiah -> the oozes ->
# Shatter Scar Vale -> Jadefire Run (Xavaric) -> Irontree Woods -> Talonbranch Glade -> Nafien, Felpaw Village and
# Timbermaw Hold -> back south to the Sanctuary -> north again through Timbermaw Hold to Everlook (flight path, bind).
# Forever's 30-60 content (Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal, the rest of the Wetlands expansion) is not in
# the data yet: this guide follows Era + known Forever quests.
# Optional extras: Feathers for Grazle and Feathers for Nafien (8466, 8467: repeatable Timbermaw reputation
# turn-ins, small experience).
# Deviations from the export:
# - The first Sanctuary turn-ins (The Corruption of the Jadefire, Forces of Jaedenar, Rescue From Jaedenar) come
#   right after the southern loop, so Further Corruption (4906), Collection of the Corrupt Water (5157) and
#   Retribution of the Light (5204) are done on the same pass north: the export walks back to Jaedenar and Jadefire
#   Run after the northern loop. Xavaric then drops his flute (939) on the one visit to Jadefire Run.
# - Talonbranch Glade's flight path is added on the way north: it shortens the final ride from the Sanctuary.
# Carried on: Speak to Salfa (8465) for Winterspring, Felbound Ancients (4441)
# for Darnassus, Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158) for the Barrens, A Little Slime Goes a Long Way (4512) for Ironforge.
# Optional, by rare drop or reputation: the Blood Red Key chain (5202, 5203, 5204, 5385: the key drops about one
# Jaedenar kill in thirty), Deadwood Ritual Totem (8470: a 3% drop, and the Timbermaw speak to you only from
# Neutral, which the route does not reach) and Runecloth (6031, Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold, same rule).
# Left out: the old Timbermaw Ally and Deadwood of the North (6131, 6221): they pay no experience in the data and
# were replaced by 8460 and 8461, which are done here.
guide forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood
title Felwood
faction Alliance
levels 52-54
zone Felwood
next forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Getting there

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip Take the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine and fly to Astranaar.
  fly "Astranaar"

step Grazle
  zone Felwood
  tip Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood. Grazle the furbolg stands by the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary.
  accept 8460

step Deadwood Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of Grazle; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop.
  kill 7153 quest 8460.1              -- Deadwood Warrior
  kill 7155 quest 8460.2              -- Deadwood Pathfinder
  kill 7154 quest 8460.3              -- Deadwood Gardener

step Grazle
  turnin 8460
  accept 8462                         -- Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood
  accept 8466 optional                -- Five feathers buy a little Timbermaw reputation
  turnin 8466 optional

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  accept 4421                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  accept 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  accept 4101                         -- Arathandris Silversky, in the ruins just east of Grazle

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Jadefire Glen
  tip The Jadefire satyrs hold the glen west of the road, with Xavathras at its back.
  kill 7109 quest 4421.1              -- Jadefire Felsworn
  kill 7110 quest 4421.2              -- Jadefire Shadowstalker
  kill 7106 quest 4421.3              -- Jadefire Rogue
  kill 9454 quest 4421.4              -- Xavathras

step Jaedenar
  tip Jaedenar is the ruined temple north of the glen. Some of its cultists drop a Blood Red Key, about one kill in thirty: it opens Arko'narin's cell in Shadow Hold, the cave at the back. If it drops, clear the way out before you free her; if not, skip her quests.
  kill 7125 quest 5155.1              -- Jaedenar Hound
  kill 7115 quest 5155.3              -- Jaedenar Adept
  kill 7112 quest 5155.4              -- Jaedenar Cultist
  kill 7113 quest 5155.2              -- Jaedenar Guardian
  collect 13140 optional              -- Blood Red Key, a rare drop
  accept 5202 optional
  turnin 5202 optional                -- Captured Arko'narin, in Shadow Hold
  accept 5203 optional
  complete 5203 optional              -- Keep her alive until she is out of the cave

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  turnin 4421                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  accept 4906
  turnin 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5157
  turnin 5203 optional                -- Jessir Moonbow
  accept 5204 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Jaedenar again
  tip Use the Empty Canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of Jaedenar. If you freed Arko'narin, go back into Shadow Hold for the succubus Rakaiah; Trey Lightforge's remains lie beside her.
  collect 12907 quest 5157.1
  kill 9518 quest 5204.1 optional     -- Rakaiah
  turnin 5204 optional                -- Remains of Trey Lightforge
  accept 5385 optional

step Oozes
  tip The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Falls: kill them and use Laris's Empty Ooze Jars on their remains.
  collect 11947 quest 4512.1          -- Filled Cursed Ooze Jar
  collect 11949 quest 4512.2          -- Filled Tainted Ooze Jar

step Shatter Scar Vale
  tip Follow the road north to the cratered vale and walk to each crater, killing the Entropic Beasts and Horrors between them.
  kill 9878 quest 5156.1              -- Entropic Beast
  kill 9879 quest 5156.2              -- Entropic Horror
  goto 41.6,43.0 "First crater"
  goto 40.4,41.2 "Second crater"
  goto 42.2,40.3 "Third crater"
  complete 5156

step Jadefire Run
  tip Jadefire Run is the satyr valley in the north-west, with Xavaric at its far end. He drops the Flute of Xavaric; every Jadefire satyr can drop Jadefire Felbind.
  kill 7111 quest 4906.1              -- Jadefire Hellcaller
  kill 7108 quest 4906.2              -- Jadefire Betrayer
  kill 7107 quest 4906.3              -- Jadefire Trickster
  kill 10648 quest 4906.4             -- Xavaric
  collect 11668                       -- Flute of Xavaric
  accept 939
  collect 11674 quest 939.1           -- Jadefire Felbind

step Irontree Woods
  tip The Warpwood treants of Irontree Woods, east of Jadefire Run, carry the Blood Amber.
  collect 11503 quest 4101.1

step Talonbranch Glade
  tip Ride east to the night elf camp at Talonbranch Glade.
  getfp "Talonbranch Glade"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Timbermaw Hold

step Nafien
  tip Follow the road north to the cave mouth of Timbermaw Hold; Nafien guards it.
  turnin 8462
  accept 8461

step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave. The Avengers can drop a Deadwood Ritual Totem.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1              -- Deadwood Den Watcher
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2              -- Deadwood Avenger
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3              -- Deadwood Shaman
  collect 20741 optional              -- Deadwood Ritual Totem, a rare drop
  accept 8470 optional

step Nafien
  turnin 8461
  accept 8465                         -- Salfa stands at the Winterspring end of the tunnel: keep it
  accept 8467 optional
  turnin 8467 optional

step Timbermaw Hold
  tip Step into the cave: Kernda and Meilosh stand just inside.
  turnin 8470 optional                -- Kernda: the Timbermaw speak to you only from Neutral
  accept 6031 optional                -- Meilosh: thirty Runecloth, handed in when you pass through again at 57

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back south

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Fly from Talonbranch Glade to the Sanctuary's end of the road, or ride south along it.
  turnin 4906                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  turnin 939
  accept 4441                         -- The vial is filled in Darnassus: keep it
  turnin 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  turnin 5385 optional                -- Jessir Moonbow
  turnin 5157                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5158                         -- Ends in the Barrens: keep it
  turnin 4101                         -- Arathandris Silversky

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Everlook

step Everlook
  zone Winterspring
  tip Ride north to Timbermaw Hold (or fly back to Talonbranch Glade first) and through the tunnel into Winterspring; follow the road east to the goblin town of Everlook.
  getfp "Everlook"
  sethome "Everlook"
